<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: attunement ritual -->
  <VV_Attunement.label>共鳴儀式</VV_Attunement.label>
  <!-- EN: A Royal vivi enters resonance with an everflower through psychic attunement. A royal vivi can attune to only one everflower at a time, and if a royal vivi already in resonance performs the attunement ritual, it deepens the everflower's attunement level. -->
  <VV_Attunement.description>令一名皇家薇薇同一株永盛花產生心靈共鳴。一名皇家薇薇同時只能同一株永盛花共鳴，若其已經與永盛花共鳴，該儀式會提升永盛花的共鳴等級。</VV_Attunement.description>
  
</LanguageData>